```spl
`SOC Lab Detection Rule`
`Rule Name: Suspicious Executable File Creation in User-Writable Paths`
`Event ID: 11 (FileCreate)`
`MITRE ATT&CK: T1105 (Ingress Tool Transfer), T1036 (Masquerading)`
`Severity: High`
`Data Source: XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational | index=blue`
`Description: Flags creation of executable (.exe) files in user-writable or temporary directories (Temp, AppData, Downloads, Public, Desktop, ProgramData).`
```

index=blue EventCode=11
| eval File_Path=coalesce(TargetFilename,Target_File_Name)
| where match(File_Path,"(?i)\\(temp|appdata|downloads|public|desktop|programdata)\\") AND match(File_Path,"(?i)\.exe$")
| table _time host User Image File_Path
| sort - _time
